<title>UK: Tokyo-Mitsubishi lead 10 bln yen four-year bond.</title>
<headline>Tokyo-Mitsubishi lead 10 bln yen four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Tokyo-Mitsubishi International Plc.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LOAN PARTICIPATION GLOBAL INVESTMENT COMPANY NO.1</p>
<p>		(SERIES D)</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON     1.60	MATURITY    31.JAN.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    31.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> DENOMS (M) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP/CAYMAN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENG/JAP   TAX PROVS  NO GROSS-UP PROVISIONS</p>
<p> NOTES	BACKED BY THE PARTICIPATION INTERESTS IN LOANS</p>
<p>		SENIOR, UNSECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
